", "mentions": [{"text": "Arc", "status": "confirmed"}], "kind_hint": "post", "url": "https://t.me/whitelist1/7135", "time": "2026-09-14T12:04:00+00:00"}, {"id": "telegram:1:7135#s2", "text": "Trading / Launchpads:
